{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18105200","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18105200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1810520001:0":{"text":"시간이 흘러 달빛이 한층 더 밝아졌다. 은은한 빛무리가 거대한 뼈들 틈새를 비집고 백골의 집 안으로 스며들었다.","source_cn":"时间流逝，骨屋外的月色渐渐变得明亮，透过巨骨之间的缝隙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C60DE69A1497048","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1810520002:0":{"text":"그리고 세인의 얼굴 위로 무거운 침묵이 내려앉았다.","source_cn":"瑟恩向窗外望了一眼，神情逐渐严肃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x660D0EC7E9425B38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1810520003:0":{"text":"곧 <style=\"highlight\">만월</style>인데 바든과 에리스가 아직 돌아오지 않았다.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>满月</style>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9142E01B2F2206F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810520004:0":{"text":"아직도? 대체 뭘 하러 간 게야?","source_cn":"没回来？他们去干嘛了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D803221E3D589DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1810520004":{"text":"아직도? 대체 뭘 하러 간 게야?","source_cn":"没回来？他们去干嘛了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D803221E3D589DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"",